#: globalPlugins/samsungGalaxyVoices.py:587
msgid ""
"Samsung voice data and its matching speech engine will be downloaded directly from "
"Samsung and stored in your NVDA user-data folder. Samsung owns these components, and "
"this unofficial add-on is not affiliated with or endorsed by Samsung. Continue?"
msgstr "三星语音数据及其匹配的语音引擎将直接从三星下载并存储在你的 NVDA 用户数据文件夹中。这些组件归三星所有，此非官方插件不隶属于三星，也未获得三星认可。是否继续？"

